WEBVTT

01:31.552 --> 01:34.359
[Episode 24]

01:34.359 --> 01:38.480
Brother, you must remember the way home

01:38.480 --> 01:40.799
and come back to see me often.

01:40.799 --> 01:44.079
[Elder Brother Sheng's Grave]
Miss Yan lets us grow vegetables and fruits,

01:44.079 --> 01:45.900
solely for Bofeng House.

01:46.840 --> 01:48.739
Life is much easier now.

01:49.640 --> 01:52.519
Don't worry about me anymore.

01:52.519 --> 01:54.100
I'll be fine

01:56.260 --> 01:57.819
on my own.

01:58.439 --> 02:01.200
Brother, over there,

02:01.200 --> 02:03.859
will you meet someone named Huang Bo?

02:06.840 --> 02:08.659
He was about your age.

02:10.039 --> 02:15.379
He was also a really good man.

02:16.400 --> 02:18.300
If you meet,

02:19.560 --> 02:22.259
you must take good care of each other.

02:23.560 --> 02:25.060
Don't move.

02:27.719 --> 02:29.599
I'm just listening to your heartbeat

02:29.599 --> 02:31.699
to see if you're getting better.

02:34.360 --> 02:35.439
Don't be shy.

02:35.439 --> 02:38.120
My name is Luo.
I am a resident of Wangxian Valley.

02:38.120 --> 02:39.560
What is your name?

02:39.560 --> 02:41.240
My name is Huang Bo.

02:41.240 --> 02:42.900
Huang Bo?

02:44.520 --> 02:46.020
Miss Luo,

02:47.479 --> 02:49.180
my gratitude cannot be spoken.

02:52.680 --> 02:54.180
Thank you.

02:58.560 --> 03:01.199
Is it not pretty?

03:01.199 --> 03:02.800
I think it's very pretty.

03:02.800 --> 03:06.219
This is the most special wreath
I've ever seen.

03:17.560 --> 03:19.060
Does it look good?

03:20.599 --> 03:22.099
It looks good.

03:47.520 --> 03:51.828
[Gu Mansion]

04:18.319 --> 04:19.819
Master.

04:23.399 --> 04:25.360
You're here.

04:25.360 --> 04:27.660
I came to see you and Madam.

04:45.399 --> 04:47.060
She was so young.

04:48.079 --> 04:49.939
Why did it have to be her?

04:50.959 --> 04:52.459
Why?

04:54.319 --> 04:58.660
Master, why was there an assassin
in your mansion?

05:00.079 --> 05:01.620
It was not an assassin.

05:02.439 --> 05:03.980
It was a thief.

05:04.839 --> 05:09.139
That night, I heard a noise
and came out to check out.

05:10.240 --> 05:13.459
But that thief drew a knife...

05:14.319 --> 05:15.819
Ling Yi...

05:17.240 --> 05:22.120
Ling Yi... Ling Yi took the knife for me.

05:22.120 --> 05:23.720
My lord!

05:23.720 --> 05:25.220
My lord!

05:27.879 --> 05:29.480
My lord,

05:29.480 --> 05:33.379
the physician said Lady Yuan
had been pregnant for a month.

05:40.000 --> 05:41.000
Master?

05:41.000 --> 05:42.939
- My lord.
- What's wrong?

05:44.279 --> 05:46.819
L-Ling Yi,

05:47.800 --> 05:50.240
why didn't you tell me

05:50.240 --> 05:52.540
that we had a child?

05:58.360 --> 06:03.000
Had you stayed in the room that night,
nothing would have happened.

06:03.000 --> 06:08.180
But now both you and our child are gone.

06:12.959 --> 06:14.459
It's all my fault.

06:15.240 --> 06:17.079
It's all my fault.

06:17.079 --> 06:18.879
I failed to protect you.

06:18.879 --> 06:20.120
I failed you.

06:20.120 --> 06:22.240
I failed our child.

06:22.240 --> 06:24.519
I failed you.

06:24.519 --> 06:26.000
I failed our child.

06:26.000 --> 06:27.680
I failed you.

06:27.680 --> 06:28.839
Master,

06:28.839 --> 06:31.160
I know this is a heavy grief for you.

06:31.160 --> 06:33.240
But the living will still remain.

06:33.240 --> 06:35.379
Please do not let grief wear you down.

06:41.120 --> 06:42.620
You are young.

06:43.519 --> 06:49.399
You don't understand how painful it is
to live a whole life alone.

06:49.399 --> 06:53.379
This journey... this journey is so hard.

07:01.240 --> 07:03.019
Lord Gu, my condolences.

07:22.480 --> 07:24.439
Lord Gu,

07:24.439 --> 07:26.879
His Majesty understands how you feel

07:26.879 --> 07:28.800
and sent me with a word.

07:28.800 --> 07:31.240
He has granted you
a seven-day leave from court

07:31.240 --> 07:33.319
to focus on your family.

07:33.319 --> 07:34.759
Lady Yuan's passing was sudden.

07:34.759 --> 07:36.279
Heaven's will is unpredictable.

07:36.279 --> 07:38.899
If you need anything, just ask.

07:40.519 --> 07:42.319
The imperial grace is vast.

07:42.319 --> 07:45.180
I am endlessly grateful.

07:47.519 --> 07:50.920
Zhi Li, let's leave for now.

07:50.920 --> 07:53.120
Lord Gu's love for his wife was boundless.

07:53.120 --> 07:55.060
Let them be alone for a while.

08:01.560 --> 08:03.120
Master,

08:03.120 --> 08:05.160
Lady Yuan's spirit in heaven

08:05.160 --> 08:08.040
would not wish to see you so grief-stricken.

08:08.040 --> 08:09.620
I take my leave now.

08:16.000 --> 08:17.500
My child.

08:19.560 --> 08:22.339
My child.

08:25.079 --> 08:27.620
My child.

08:31.480 --> 08:33.259
My child.

08:37.344 --> 08:39.008
[Spirit Tablet of Lady Ling Yi,
Wife of the Chancellor]

08:39.008 --> 08:41.400
[Censorate]

08:41.400 --> 08:43.860
The imperial edict has arrived.

08:54.559 --> 08:57.620
All of the officials in the Censorate,
heed the decree.

09:00.720 --> 09:03.519
Since Meng Ting Hui
took charge of the Censorate,

09:03.519 --> 09:06.559
she's been unfailingly diligent
and unwavering in her duties.

09:06.559 --> 09:09.960
Profound in talent
and far-sighted in strategy,

09:09.960 --> 09:12.200
she's repeatedly relieved me of my troubles.

09:12.200 --> 09:14.600
She is truly my right hand.

09:14.600 --> 09:17.960
Her efforts against evil and traitors
have been outstanding,

09:17.960 --> 09:20.559
and her protection of me is beyond reproach.

09:20.559 --> 09:24.399
I am deeply pleased
and commend her loyal valor.

09:24.399 --> 09:28.320
She is hereby
appointed as Director of the Censorate

09:28.320 --> 09:30.679
of the Senior Third Rank

09:30.679 --> 09:32.620
with a twofold salary.

09:34.279 --> 09:37.000
Predictions for the women's Provincial Exam!

09:37.000 --> 09:38.779
Bidding starts at thirty taels.

09:41.360 --> 09:42.899
Stop!

09:44.799 --> 09:47.039
I've already worked so hard.

09:47.039 --> 09:49.519
I've worked very hard.

09:49.519 --> 09:51.720
In this world,

09:51.720 --> 09:53.700
the shameless

09:55.120 --> 09:57.620
live longer than the reckless.

10:15.530 --> 10:17.220
The world is dark and murky,

10:17.960 --> 10:19.360
and the night is endless.

10:19.360 --> 10:21.960
Since the late Emperor
allowed women to become officials,

10:21.960 --> 10:23.279
few female officials

10:23.279 --> 10:25.639
have been able to serve a full term.

10:25.639 --> 10:27.240
Women belong at home,

10:27.240 --> 10:28.759
tending to their husbands and children.

10:28.759 --> 10:29.960
An ominous star causing chaos,

10:29.960 --> 10:31.519
and the reincarnation of a fox spirit!

10:31.519 --> 10:33.720
The heavens are unkind,

10:33.720 --> 10:35.639
and tears wet my robes.

10:35.639 --> 10:37.080
I sign this pledge with blood.

10:37.080 --> 10:40.379
If I fail the Palace Exam, I am willing
to be assigned to the Music Bureau.

10:44.399 --> 10:48.379
Fierce winds and sudden rain,
what is there to fear?

10:56.320 --> 10:58.460
I shall be the sword

11:00.480 --> 11:02.379
that slays the fiends.

11:04.759 --> 11:06.259
Execute!

11:17.960 --> 11:18.960
<i>Ting Hui.</i>

11:18.960 --> 11:20.860
<i>- Meng.
- Miss Meng.</i>

11:20.860 --> 11:22.159
<i>Miss Meng.</i>

11:22.159 --> 11:23.480
<i>- Miss Meng.
- Huiyuan Meng.</i>

11:23.480 --> 11:24.679
<i>Meng.</i>

11:24.679 --> 11:27.000
<i>- Zhuangyuan Meng.
- Miss Meng.</i>

11:27.000 --> 11:28.500
<i>Zhuangyuan Meng.</i>

11:35.960 --> 11:38.240
Shen Zhi Li and Yin Qing are promoted

11:38.240 --> 11:41.200
to be Left and Right Judges of the Censorate

11:41.200 --> 11:42.440
with a twofold salary.

11:42.440 --> 11:45.279
I trust that Meng Ting Hui,
Shen Zhi Li, and Yin Qing

11:45.279 --> 11:47.600
will continue to uphold justice,

11:47.600 --> 11:50.080
root out corruption, and safeguard the court

11:50.080 --> 11:53.600
to share my burdens and serve the people.

11:53.600 --> 11:56.419
I thank Your Majesty for your grace.

12:06.159 --> 12:09.559
I've been fortunate to have you both
along the journey.

12:09.559 --> 12:11.960
I should be grateful to have met you.

12:11.960 --> 12:13.159
Without you,

12:13.159 --> 12:16.240
I probably would've been
a routine Hanlin scholar my whole life.

12:16.240 --> 12:17.799
Following you to handle cases,

12:17.799 --> 12:20.759
I've witnessed many things
I never dared to imagine before.

12:20.759 --> 12:23.299
I have never regretted joining the Censorate.

12:24.200 --> 12:26.100
Wait.

12:26.100 --> 12:27.679
Why still call her Miss Meng?

12:27.679 --> 12:30.779
We should call her Director Meng.

12:32.399 --> 12:34.159
Thank you, Director Meng, for taking me in.

12:34.159 --> 12:37.470
I always said Director Meng
is a phoenix in hiding,

12:37.470 --> 12:38.639
destined to soar high.

12:38.639 --> 12:39.720
By following Director Meng,

12:39.720 --> 12:42.440
not only can we feast on delicacies,

12:42.440 --> 12:45.620
but even our official careers
advance step by step.

12:47.960 --> 12:49.799
Wait a moment.

12:49.799 --> 12:51.899
What position was I promoted to again?

12:54.360 --> 12:56.539
Judge Yin.

12:57.279 --> 12:58.399
To Director Meng.

12:58.399 --> 12:59.679
To Judge Shen.

12:59.679 --> 13:01.940
To Judge Yin.

13:07.296 --> 13:10.484
[Censorate]

13:11.600 --> 13:13.960
Although we have captured Ling Yun Fei,

13:13.960 --> 13:16.519
we still need to find the person behind him.

13:16.519 --> 13:18.940
Director Meng, the things are here.

13:23.799 --> 13:26.279
I granted you all a day off.

13:26.279 --> 13:28.139
Why are you still working on the case?

13:29.120 --> 13:30.279
Greetings, Your Majesty.

13:30.279 --> 13:31.440
Rise.

13:31.440 --> 13:33.320
Does Your Majesty not know Director Meng?

13:33.320 --> 13:34.480
The case is not yet closed.

13:34.480 --> 13:36.120
So she doesn't care about rest days.

13:36.120 --> 13:40.120
Your Majesty, what brings you
to the Censorate on this unexpected visit?

13:40.120 --> 13:43.460
What? If there is nothing,
can I not come to see you...

13:44.399 --> 13:45.899
See you all?

13:56.279 --> 13:57.679
Your Majesty, don't misunderstand.

13:57.679 --> 13:59.320
These things are not from the Censorate.

13:59.320 --> 14:01.919
They're goods confiscated
from Wanxiang Pavilion and the Huxiao Gang.

14:01.919 --> 14:03.600
I know.

14:03.600 --> 14:06.820
With Director Meng here,
who would dare to embezzle?

14:08.860 --> 14:10.600
We already checked these before

14:10.600 --> 14:11.879
and found no issues.

14:11.879 --> 14:13.940
We've decided to check them out again.

14:17.840 --> 14:19.080
Anything unusual about it?

14:19.080 --> 14:21.779
It is a Maojing pendant,
a tribute from Beijian.

14:22.399 --> 14:24.000
There are only two of these.

14:24.000 --> 14:26.279
My father bestowed them
upon the two chancellors.

14:26.279 --> 14:28.639
If Ling Yun Fei truly
has a chancellor backing him,

14:28.639 --> 14:30.720
then it is no wonder he acted so arrogantly.

14:30.720 --> 14:32.299
It could never be Lord Gu.

14:47.080 --> 14:49.440
Do you recognize this pendant?

14:49.440 --> 14:53.200
You never saw Liu Ru Yan
in her final moments, did you?

14:53.200 --> 14:58.240
Someone hit her repeatedly with a candlestick

14:58.240 --> 15:00.360
until her skull was smashed.

15:00.360 --> 15:03.480
When she died, her face was covered in blood,

15:03.480 --> 15:05.080
spilling all over the floor.

15:05.080 --> 15:07.639
Liu Ru Yan cherished her appearance,

15:07.639 --> 15:10.639
but in the end,
not even her face was left intact.

15:10.639 --> 15:12.139
Tell me,

15:13.559 --> 15:15.820
what kind of hatred could be so deep

15:16.440 --> 15:18.399
to do such a cruel thing?

15:18.399 --> 15:20.919
Meng Ting Hui, shut up! Shut up!

15:20.919 --> 15:23.159
Even before she died,
Liu Ru Yan was thinking of you.

15:23.159 --> 15:27.000
She wanted to tell you
who exactly killed her.

15:27.000 --> 15:30.440
During her desperate struggle,
she tore off this jade pendant

15:30.440 --> 15:32.700
from the killer's body!

15:36.200 --> 15:37.639
You recognize it?

15:37.639 --> 15:39.759
There are only two of these Maojing pendants.

15:39.759 --> 15:42.120
The late Emperor bestowed them
upon the two chancellors.

15:42.120 --> 15:43.480
The killer

15:43.480 --> 15:46.000
is either Xu Ting

15:46.000 --> 15:48.340
- or Gu Qin.
- Impossible.

15:48.340 --> 15:50.310
- Shut up!
- Ling Yun Fei!

15:50.310 --> 15:51.720
Don't you understand yet?

15:51.720 --> 15:53.559
He took out Liu Ru Yan

15:53.559 --> 15:55.759
because I traced it to Liu Ru Yan.

15:55.759 --> 15:58.240
He knew Liu Ru Yan was your most beloved,

15:58.240 --> 15:59.960
yet he still killed her.

15:59.960 --> 16:01.600
Because in his heart,

16:01.600 --> 16:03.159
he has never been protecting you,

16:03.159 --> 16:04.320
- Shut up!
- but himself!

16:04.320 --> 16:05.600
Shut up! Shut up!

16:05.600 --> 16:06.759
Say it!

16:06.759 --> 16:09.019
Let's avenge Liu Ru Yan together!

16:15.320 --> 16:16.820
Meng Ting Hui,

16:17.960 --> 16:20.299
haven't you dreamed of killing me?

16:21.360 --> 16:22.480
Do it!

16:22.480 --> 16:25.179
He has never considered you.

16:26.000 --> 16:28.919
Why do you stay silent
and protect him like this?

16:28.919 --> 16:33.139
In his eyes, you are just a dog he kept!

16:36.879 --> 16:38.379
Meng Ting Hui,

16:39.519 --> 16:42.700
you're also just a mad dog
kept by the Emperor!

16:48.919 --> 16:52.500
The Poisoned People's Mound killers this time
share the same moves

16:52.500 --> 16:55.960
as those from the Blood Moon Society
who fought Zhi Shu.

16:55.960 --> 16:58.360
And they deliberately avoided Meng Ting Hui.

16:58.360 --> 17:01.399
Meng Ting Hui is undoubtedly
the Zhongwan princess.

17:01.399 --> 17:04.839
Your Majesty also witnessed
the Blood Moon Society's attempt to kill you.

17:04.839 --> 17:05.839
Have you ever thought

17:05.839 --> 17:08.720
Meng Ting Hui's blocking the arrow that day
was just a ruse?

17:08.720 --> 17:11.640
A spy from Zhongwan
has long been lurking by her side,

17:11.640 --> 17:12.799
waiting to move.

17:12.799 --> 17:15.640
Your concerns are not without reason.

17:15.640 --> 17:17.480
But if it were as you say,

17:17.480 --> 17:20.539
why would they force Meng Ting Hui
to take the Eternity Pill?

17:23.680 --> 17:25.880
Your Majesty, Director Meng has sent words.

17:25.880 --> 17:26.880
Ling Yun Fei has awakened.

17:26.880 --> 17:28.930
He hasn't named his court contact yet,

17:28.930 --> 17:31.599
but he's confessed the pharmacist
is from Blood Moon Society.

17:31.599 --> 17:34.400
The Huxiao Gang and the Blood Moon Society
did make Eternity Pills together.

17:34.400 --> 17:36.900
It seems my deduction is correct.

17:43.799 --> 17:46.079
The Fuqing herb is a herb unique to Zhongwan

17:46.079 --> 17:47.559
and contains a potent poison.

17:47.559 --> 17:49.119
For safety's sake,
the Zhongwan royals took it

17:49.119 --> 17:51.680
from childhood to be immune to all poisons.

17:51.680 --> 17:53.559
Her body has already developed resistance.

17:53.559 --> 17:55.279
That's why she wasn't seriously affected.

17:55.279 --> 17:57.000
Meng Ting Hui has offered her own blood

17:57.000 --> 17:59.400
to the imperial physicians
to make an antidote for Eternity Pills.

17:59.400 --> 18:01.670
If they were colluding,

18:01.670 --> 18:04.160
why would they leave such a flaw?

18:04.160 --> 18:06.000
And why would Meng Ting Hui do this?

18:06.000 --> 18:07.799
But while the Blood Moon Society remains,

18:07.799 --> 18:10.480
Meng Ting Hui is a sharp blade
hanging by Your Majesty's side,

18:10.480 --> 18:13.119
which could turn at any moment.

18:13.119 --> 18:14.839
Your father had great foresight back then,

18:14.839 --> 18:16.640
demoting the Zhongwan royals to slave status

18:16.640 --> 18:17.759
and barring them from official positions

18:17.759 --> 18:19.920
to prevent trouble before it occurs.

18:19.920 --> 18:21.880
But Your Majesty has insisted on promoting

18:21.880 --> 18:23.440
and placing great trust in their princess.

18:23.440 --> 18:27.160
What you are gambling with
is the vast realm of the Ning Empire.

18:27.160 --> 18:29.440
Father, Director Meng risked her life
to protect His Majesty.

18:29.440 --> 18:31.599
She is unpredictable, and we must be wary.

18:31.599 --> 18:33.200
If everyone were as naive as you,

18:33.200 --> 18:35.680
where would all the blood and tears
in history come from?

18:35.680 --> 18:37.519
Do you believe

18:37.519 --> 18:42.660
that my father's decision
regarding Zhongwan was entirely correct?

18:46.359 --> 18:48.680
What I want is not submissive subjects,

18:48.680 --> 18:50.859
but the allegiance of all under heaven.

18:56.400 --> 18:58.039
I sincerely

18:58.039 --> 19:00.530
admire Your Majesty's vision and foresight.

19:00.530 --> 19:03.720
But what worries me is Your Majesty's safety.

19:03.720 --> 19:06.000
The Blood Moon Society
already knows Meng Ting Hui's identity,

19:06.000 --> 19:08.720
yet they have allowed her to rise steadily
by Your Majesty's side,

19:08.720 --> 19:10.319
becoming a key official of the Ning Empire.

19:10.319 --> 19:13.319
They are surely brewing a plot
to restore their nation.

19:13.319 --> 19:15.319
The Blood Moon Society lurks in the shadows,

19:15.319 --> 19:16.640
watching with covetous eyes,

19:16.640 --> 19:18.079
so I keep Meng Ting Hui close

19:18.079 --> 19:20.559
to make sure they dare not strike.

19:20.559 --> 19:23.680
Is this not also a form of balance?

19:23.680 --> 19:25.240
Your Majesty, what about Huiyin House?

19:25.240 --> 19:28.079
Take Di Nian
and search Huiyin House immediately.

19:28.079 --> 19:29.079
Given the Blood Moon Society's cunning,

19:29.079 --> 19:30.319
they've probably already fled.

19:30.319 --> 19:34.279
But even so, you must investigate thoroughly.

19:34.279 --> 19:35.779
As you command.

20:11.590 --> 20:15.019
Chancellors, do you recognize what this is?

20:19.119 --> 20:20.619
A Maojing pendant?

20:22.160 --> 20:23.519
Your Majesty,

20:23.519 --> 20:25.129
your father gave me

20:25.129 --> 20:27.960
and Lord Xu each
a Maojing pendant from Beijian.

20:27.960 --> 20:30.180
Then why is it in my hand?

20:38.319 --> 20:39.440
Your Majesty,

20:39.440 --> 20:40.839
- mine...
- Your Majesty,

20:40.839 --> 20:42.339
I know my crime.

20:43.160 --> 20:45.319
I carelessly lost it.

20:45.319 --> 20:46.799
Where did you lose it?

20:46.799 --> 20:51.079
I was careless
and cannot recall where I lost it.

20:51.079 --> 20:53.380
I never thought Your Majesty would find it.

20:54.119 --> 20:55.359
I am terrified.

20:55.359 --> 20:57.440
So it's yours, Lord Xu.

20:57.440 --> 20:59.619
Then where is yours, Lord Gu?

21:03.720 --> 21:05.759
Your Majesty,

21:05.759 --> 21:07.640
my late wife

21:07.640 --> 21:10.799
hoped that I could be safe and well
all her life.

21:10.799 --> 21:12.440
She treasured the imperial gifts above all

21:12.440 --> 21:15.759
and always said the pendant
was a sign of your grace.

21:15.759 --> 21:19.559
Even in her final moments,
she still held the pendant

21:19.559 --> 21:22.460
and told me to always respect your grace.

21:23.640 --> 21:26.640
I couldn't bear to let her go alone.

21:26.640 --> 21:28.140
So, Your Majesty,

21:31.279 --> 21:32.279
I ventured

21:32.279 --> 21:36.920
to bury the Maojing pendant
along with my late wife, Ling Yi,

21:36.920 --> 21:38.710
thinking that in this way,

21:39.400 --> 21:41.579
she could still feel my companionship.

21:51.240 --> 21:54.720
You have always been
deeply devoted to your wife.

21:54.720 --> 21:56.220
I won't blame you.

21:57.319 --> 21:59.119
Thank you, Your Majesty.

21:59.119 --> 22:01.339
Then, Lord Xu, you must keep it safe.

22:02.260 --> 22:04.799
This Maojing pendant
was bestowed by my father.

22:04.799 --> 22:06.420
If it is truly lost,

22:07.390 --> 22:10.099
I am afraid you would have to pay
with your head.

22:12.759 --> 22:14.079
Thank you, Your Majesty.

22:14.079 --> 22:17.460
I will certainly keep it carefully
and never lose it again.

22:18.960 --> 22:21.119
With the Huxiao Gang destroyed,

22:21.119 --> 22:24.039
the gang leader, Ling Yun Fei,
will be executed in public tomorrow.

22:24.039 --> 22:27.610
I hope you two will supervise the execution

22:27.610 --> 22:29.420
to uphold the law.

22:33.920 --> 22:34.920
Yes.

22:34.920 --> 22:37.000
Yes, Your Majesty.

22:37.000 --> 22:40.400
I am a little tired.
You may take your leave now.

22:40.400 --> 22:42.140
We take our leave.

23:07.319 --> 23:11.039
Does Your Majesty believe
what the two chancellors just said?

23:11.039 --> 23:13.279
Both chancellors are meticulous

23:13.279 --> 23:15.119
and deeply calculating.

23:15.119 --> 23:17.700
How could their depth be tested
with just a few words?

23:18.880 --> 23:20.660
What is the situation with Ling Yun Fei?

23:22.079 --> 23:23.920
With both coaxing and coercion,

23:23.920 --> 23:26.259
Ling Yun Fei still refused to speak at all.

23:27.839 --> 23:29.279
Since he won't talk,

23:29.279 --> 23:31.539
we'll settle it at the execution ground.

23:32.359 --> 23:35.660
I heard that Your Majesty
recently raided Huiyin House.

23:37.920 --> 23:40.440
Situ Xue is a spy from Zhongwan,

23:40.440 --> 23:43.839
and Huiyin House was where
the Blood Moon Society gathered information

23:43.839 --> 23:46.640
and planned their moves in secret.

23:46.640 --> 23:48.460
Situ Xue?

23:51.359 --> 23:52.859
Zhongwan?

24:06.599 --> 24:08.099
What's wrong?

24:09.880 --> 24:11.380
A headache?

24:12.039 --> 24:13.539
It's nothing.

24:16.000 --> 24:18.099
Maybe I've been too tired lately.

24:19.079 --> 24:21.420
I keep having very strange dreams.

24:26.039 --> 24:28.900
Since they are dreams,
don't think about them anymore.

24:29.550 --> 24:31.940
Tomorrow, I will take you to a quiet place.

25:21.680 --> 25:25.220
From today on, it's yours.

25:26.960 --> 25:29.920
This is Your Majesty's most beloved horse.

25:29.920 --> 25:31.680
Are you truly willing to part with it?

25:31.680 --> 25:33.039
Of course.

25:33.039 --> 25:34.960
I have renamed it.

25:34.960 --> 25:36.819
It's now named Qingyun Buzhui.

25:37.799 --> 25:39.559
What does that mean?

25:39.559 --> 25:44.019
May you soar to the highest heights
and never fall.

25:45.720 --> 25:48.680
Your Majesty has promoted me
three ranks in a row,

25:48.680 --> 25:50.960
and now you are giving me Qingyun Buzhui.

25:50.960 --> 25:52.960
Are you not afraid
I will invite criticism again?

25:52.960 --> 25:54.720
With you and me united in court,

25:54.720 --> 25:57.579
any criticism or misunderstanding
is not worth worrying about.

25:59.319 --> 26:03.319
For years, no female official in Ning Empire
has ever made a lasting mark in the court.

26:03.319 --> 26:06.400
Not because women are incapable,

26:06.400 --> 26:08.680
but because the world does not allow it.

26:08.680 --> 26:12.619
Now, this horse can only be ridden by you.

26:13.640 --> 26:16.160
Since Your Majesty says so,

26:16.160 --> 26:19.299
I will accept Qingyun Buzhui.

26:39.000 --> 26:41.119
When I first met you,

26:41.119 --> 26:43.859
you were full of schemes and cunning words.

26:44.960 --> 26:48.640
Later, you defied power
and never pandered to the throne.

26:48.640 --> 26:50.940
You even dared to argue with me.

26:52.260 --> 26:54.140
But it was precisely you

26:55.230 --> 26:57.779
who showed me a resilience no one else has.

27:02.440 --> 27:03.940
Meng Ting Hui,

27:05.400 --> 27:07.460
I know how hard

27:08.760 --> 27:10.770
your journey has been.

27:10.770 --> 27:13.090
As an Emperor,

27:13.090 --> 27:15.700
I am long accustomed
to weighing pros and cons

27:15.700 --> 27:18.079
and to forbearance and restraint.

27:18.079 --> 27:19.580
I originally thought

27:19.580 --> 27:22.670
no one could shake my emotions.

27:22.670 --> 27:24.240
But then you

27:25.460 --> 27:27.180
suddenly barged in.

27:28.599 --> 27:30.099
Meng Ting Hui,

27:32.079 --> 27:34.019
I am fond of you.

27:39.960 --> 27:41.779
For a ruler and his subject in love,

27:42.519 --> 27:44.640
even a simple touch constitutes a crime.

27:44.640 --> 27:46.140
Do you dare?

27:47.160 --> 27:49.720
I am also fond of Your Majesty

27:49.720 --> 27:51.460
more than yesterday

27:52.279 --> 27:53.940
but slightly less than tomorrow.

28:50.020 --> 28:52.039
I will make a trip to the Censorate

28:52.039 --> 28:53.539
and silence him forever.

28:54.200 --> 28:56.579
The Censorate is swarming
with the Divine Guard.

28:57.599 --> 28:59.960
I'm afraid not even a fly can get in.

28:59.960 --> 29:02.579
Today, His Majesty
used the Maojing pendant to test us.

29:03.400 --> 29:07.220
I assume Ling Yun Fei already
knows about the death of Liu Ru Yan.

29:30.559 --> 29:32.830
Lord Gu, what a rare guest.

29:32.830 --> 29:35.240
Meng Ting Hui has traced the leads
to Wanxiang Pavilion.

29:35.240 --> 29:37.880
Stop distributing the Eternity Pills
at Wanxiang Pavilion now.

29:37.880 --> 29:42.960
You don't think Wanxiang Pavilion
is his only outlet, do you?

29:42.960 --> 29:47.400
His business dealings
are not yours to control.

29:47.400 --> 29:49.920
If Meng Ting Hui finds out the truth,

29:49.920 --> 29:51.480
we will all have to go down with him.

29:51.480 --> 29:53.259
That would be quite nice.

29:53.920 --> 29:57.799
I will accompany him
on the way to the underworld.

29:57.799 --> 30:00.210
He has grown increasingly insolent
over the years,

30:00.210 --> 30:02.680
defying me time and again
and refusing to obey.

30:02.680 --> 30:04.859
It's all instigated by you, you wretch.

30:07.920 --> 30:09.759
I am a wretch?

30:09.759 --> 30:13.640
Back then, when your father
was infatuated with his mother,

30:13.640 --> 30:16.200
he didn't despise her
for being from a brothel.

30:16.200 --> 30:17.700
Shut up!

30:18.400 --> 30:20.200
If you insist on this,

30:20.200 --> 30:22.559
this time, I will personally see to his end.

30:22.559 --> 30:25.400
I have my own way to get out unscathed.

30:25.400 --> 30:27.160
If you dare harm him,

30:27.160 --> 30:29.060
even if I die,

30:29.060 --> 30:31.039
I will drag you down too.

30:31.039 --> 30:33.660
I will make the people see

30:34.359 --> 30:36.980
the true face
of Ning Empire's virtuous chancellor.

30:44.440 --> 30:48.759
A lowly brothel wretch dares to threaten me?

30:48.759 --> 30:52.400
He's the one who made you chancellor.

30:52.400 --> 30:53.839
Without him,

30:53.839 --> 30:55.759
you are nothing

30:55.759 --> 30:58.460
but a useless one in an official robe.

31:19.640 --> 31:21.380
I killed Liu Ru Yan.

31:22.000 --> 31:24.180
He will definitely betray me.

31:25.799 --> 31:29.480
Whether he lives or dies
doesn't matter anymore.

31:29.480 --> 31:30.980
You may leave.

31:43.440 --> 31:45.779
I studied hard for ten years.

31:47.279 --> 31:49.180
I had no powerful family

31:49.920 --> 31:52.279
or imperial favor to rely on.

31:52.279 --> 31:56.559
I climbed up step by step all by myself.

31:56.559 --> 31:58.619
Who does Meng Ting Hui think she is?

31:59.450 --> 32:02.220
She's just
riding on His Majesty's sordid desires.

32:03.480 --> 32:04.980
And me?

32:07.200 --> 32:10.500
I planned my every step carefully.

32:11.420 --> 32:14.180
I've finally reached where I am now.

32:16.039 --> 32:17.610
Now,

32:18.890 --> 32:21.500
to think I'd be brought down
by a lowborn wretch.

32:26.200 --> 32:27.700
Ling Yun Fei,

32:29.680 --> 32:31.819
you were born to be my nemesis.

32:32.559 --> 32:35.019
I should've let you
be beaten to death back then.

32:36.359 --> 32:37.859
In the end,

32:38.920 --> 32:41.099
you're dragging me down with you.

32:42.680 --> 32:44.180
You win.

32:48.960 --> 32:51.039
Ling Yun Fei,

32:51.039 --> 32:52.539
you win.

32:53.599 --> 32:55.099
You win.

33:03.776 --> 33:06.772
[Spirit Tablet of Lady Ling Yi,
Wife of the Chancellor]

33:13.519 --> 33:15.019
You laugh at me?

33:21.799 --> 33:23.079
Even you laugh at me?

33:23.079 --> 33:25.000
[Spirit Tablet of Lady Ling Yi,
Wife of the Chancellor]

33:25.000 --> 33:27.019
What right do you have to laugh at me?

33:38.119 --> 33:39.779
A lifetime of scheming

33:41.440 --> 33:43.220
all comes to a broken end.

33:44.160 --> 33:45.900
A name to go down in history

33:47.799 --> 33:49.460
ultimately turns into a delusion.

33:50.200 --> 33:51.730
Retribution.

33:52.450 --> 33:54.140
It is all retribution!

34:36.400 --> 34:37.900
Master!

34:42.079 --> 34:43.079
Master,

34:43.079 --> 34:44.239
the deceased are gone.

34:44.239 --> 34:45.960
You must not do anything silly.

34:45.960 --> 34:49.800
Madam would not have wanted to see you
tormenting yourself like this.

34:49.800 --> 34:52.539
Master, everything will get better.

34:57.559 --> 34:59.480
Master,

34:59.480 --> 35:01.980
Madam would also want you to be well.

35:21.880 --> 35:23.380
Everything will be fine.

35:38.280 --> 35:39.440
They finally caught him.

35:39.440 --> 35:41.119
Miss Meng truly
fulfilled the military pledge.

35:41.119 --> 35:43.559
She caught the villain
and will have him publicly beheaded.

35:43.559 --> 35:45.920
From now on,
we no longer need to live in fear.

35:45.920 --> 35:47.719
- Right.
- Yes, Miss Meng is amazing!

35:47.719 --> 35:49.860
- So impressive!
- Well done!

35:50.559 --> 35:52.179
Miss Meng is formidable!

35:55.039 --> 35:56.539
Kneel!

35:57.840 --> 35:59.739
Miss Meng is so formidable!

36:03.079 --> 36:05.519
Supervised by both chancellors,

36:05.519 --> 36:07.280
what a grand display.

36:07.280 --> 36:11.780
Even if I go to the underworld,
this is enough to boast about.

36:13.559 --> 36:15.760
No wonder you have us supervise the execution

36:15.760 --> 36:17.719
after you captured Ling Yun Fei.

36:17.719 --> 36:21.719
So you just want us to see firsthand
how the commoners praise you.

36:21.719 --> 36:23.519
You caught a bandit chief,

36:23.519 --> 36:26.539
and you want to flaunt in front of me?

36:33.599 --> 36:34.880
Miss Meng is amazing!

36:34.880 --> 36:36.559
Miss Meng!

36:36.559 --> 36:38.360
- Impressive!
- Well done!

36:38.360 --> 36:40.519
Miss Meng is amazing.

36:40.519 --> 36:42.960
Thanks to Miss Meng!

36:42.960 --> 36:44.460
Ling Yun Fei,

36:45.280 --> 36:46.820
your enemy

36:47.760 --> 36:49.920
is sitting right up there.

36:49.920 --> 36:52.260
He not only killed your beloved

36:53.039 --> 36:55.579
but also wants to watch you die.

36:57.719 --> 36:59.740
I know you hate him.

36:59.740 --> 37:02.039
I came to give you one last chance.

37:02.039 --> 37:04.119
Tell me who he is.

37:04.119 --> 37:06.300
I will make him die with you.

37:21.000 --> 37:22.480
Even offering a bowl of rice?

37:22.480 --> 37:24.519
Still giving him food?

37:24.519 --> 37:27.039
He still has to be given his last meal.

37:27.039 --> 37:28.760
Still giving him food?

37:28.760 --> 37:30.980
For such a vicious criminal,

37:31.730 --> 37:34.420
you needn't trouble yourself
with the last meal.

37:35.440 --> 37:37.679
Whether it is a person of great evil

37:37.679 --> 37:39.400
or a person of outstanding merit,

37:39.400 --> 37:41.079
they are all ordinary beings.

37:41.079 --> 37:43.000
As I am the supervisor of execution,

37:43.000 --> 37:46.079
it is my duty to be just and without bias.

37:46.079 --> 37:49.360
Even when facing someone like Ling Yun Fei,
who is about to be executed,

37:49.360 --> 37:51.139
we cannot lose the rules.

37:52.800 --> 37:54.639
Lord Gu speaks with reason!

37:54.639 --> 37:56.139
Well said!

38:07.360 --> 38:08.860
Beat him!

38:14.840 --> 38:17.420
With me here, who dares bully my brother?

38:23.760 --> 38:26.260
Yun Fei, are you alright?

38:28.320 --> 38:29.820
I'm your brother.

38:33.239 --> 38:34.739
Come.

38:36.000 --> 38:37.500
It's delicious.

38:44.519 --> 38:46.110
Slow down.

38:46.110 --> 38:47.700
Don't choke.

38:49.510 --> 38:51.860
Brother, why aren't you eating?

38:52.880 --> 38:55.539
I'm not hungry. You eat more.

40:05.280 --> 40:06.780
This food tastes

40:09.000 --> 40:10.980
just like it did twenty years ago.
